menu "Project TARS"

    config TARS_AUDIO_CAPTURE_DIAGNOSTIC
        bool "Enable P4 microphone capture diagnostic"
        default y
        help
            Initialize the Waveshare ES8311 microphone path at 16 kHz mono,
            run a 20 ms capture task on Core 1, and log one-second signal and
            health summaries. This is a diagnostic baseline; it does not save
            or transmit audio and does not perform VAD.

    config TARS_AUDIO_MIC_GAIN_DB
        int "ES8311 microphone input gain (dB)"
        depends on TARS_AUDIO_CAPTURE_DIAGNOSTIC
        range 0 42
        default 24
        help
            Initial diagnostic microphone gain. Tune from measured peak,
            clipping, and noise-floor results rather than perceived loudness.

endmenu
